('Escuela de Posgrado UNMSM. Ofrece 130 programas de maestría, 34 de doctorado y 133 de segundas especialidades en las 5 áreas del conocimiento de la universidad. La Escuela de Posgrado (DGEP) está en la Av. Amézaga de la Ciudad Universitaria y atiende de lunes a viernes de 8:00 a 20:00. Sigla: DGEP. Categoría: Administración. Horario: Lun–Vie 8:00–20:00.'::text, '{"title": "Escuela de Posgrado UNMSM", "place_id": "posgrado", "position": 0, "document_id": "place-posgrado"}'::jsonb, '[-0.019500853,-0.015115218,0.031728618,-0.070003994,0.017611722,0.04742534,-0.011326189,0.03861302,0.031719323,-0.018230842,-0.057585504,-0.017315025,-0.022996232,0.03169556,0.17794046,0.0076009315,-0.023815224,0.0019565353,-0.011550028,-0.030636158,0.032148074,-0.023697166,-0.014012762,-0.016454013,-0.040330317,-0.01945605,0.0011131121,-0.004300392,0.018134482,-0.008300904,-0.031664062,0.077110715,0.0035605598,-0.040850375,0.015541463,-0.012944195,-0.0100418385,-0.01166001,-0.02056153,-0.0033120306,0.027852215,0.00022215977,-0.018561995,0.019253412,0.0101197185,0.012639601,-0.047283232,-0.073372215,-0.035843812,0.013905968,-0.044596698,-0.006950472,-0.006029334,-0.33161384,0.007741672,-0.002034671,-0.015300695,-0.041521136,0.022314532,-0.016630625,-0.062805526,0.03663948,-0.034942854,0.0052651977,-0.02251823,-0.015038415,0.009982316,0.06846185,-0.017268186,-0.00081178686,-0.0037836076,-0.019218903,-0.01824027,-0.017676175,-0.031290594,0.024298284,-0.007445774,0.018039983,-0.04234043,0.020211149,0.0014904944,0.03125276,0.0071396567,-0.018595366,0.01827674,0.018111078,-0.015759483,-0.026394999,-0.028713066,-0.0023454707,-0.012327456,0.025673322,-0.006213286,-0.07332026,0.022146761,0.00219641,0.0064213136,-0.020522226,-0.022336062,0.011667081,-0.015602344,0.021111932,0.019592574,0.017878974,0.027170796,-0.054668944,0.017094959,-0.035443347,-0.0086849565,0.016221521,-0.0011450119,0.0035840555,0.024624081,0.006219339,0.03636008,-0.3156114,0.04580236,0.0077054924,-0.03499902,-0.037491553,0.01