('Facultad de Ingeniería de Sistemas e Informática. Una de las mejores facultades de informática del Perú según múltiples rankings. Cuenta con laboratorios de cómputo modernos y grupos de investigación activos. La Facultad de Ingeniería de Sistemas e Informática (FISI) está en la Av. Amézaga, en el extremo norte del campus, y atiende de lunes a sábado de 8:00 a 22:00. Ofrece las carreras de'::text, '{"title": "Facultad de Ingeniería de Sistemas e Informática", "place_id": "fisi", "position": 0, "document_id": "place-fisi"}'::jsonb, '[0.020369023,0.017198198,0.009758618,-0.099258095,-0.023494396,0.014478734,0.024695233,0.061753247,0.023443334,-0.016570637,-0.060001034,0.003735779,-0.01128543,0.039930202,0.16193472,0.023842486,-0.0124237295,-0.024782948,0.0051188227,-0.005483065,-0.0014038152,-0.022347923,-0.043569908,-0.026793845,-0.041718315,0.03179155,0.02005675,-0.0606456,0.022994531,-0.036228903,-0.017616741,0.054407172,0.039608475,-0.0050168633,-0.014383972,0.009657841,0.032900672,-0.019477459,-0.015460934,0.038554378,0.03402286,0.02793898,-0.009788088,0.016655514,0.017802944,-0.025848955,0.0109325005,-0.041633207,0.015662309,0.03457338,0.005019162,0.02078404,0.004904439,-0.35330853,0.029622136,-0.03503225,0.012185962,-0.015405055,-0.021765849,-0.058357053,-0.0059895325,0.05745102,-0.04316861,0.00300998,-0.016392896,-0.005626962,0.020458858,0.041730404,0.010312776,-0.01350298,-0.0048775356,-0.035399374,0.01895794,-0.016763583,-0.008923227,0.002137108,-0.00077232963,0.014379564,-0.009092639,0.030818844,-0.022134408,-0.008978228,0.019511849,-0.01451919,0.0177121,-0.0006056689,-0.014786223,0.025844779,-0.03343135,-0.021431759,-0.01562904,0.029207684,-0.056050368,-0.0408871,0.022831883,-0.0142769,-0.00089943886,0.0035648227,-0.04084581,0.012861171,-0.03019799,0.003966651,0.008566152,0.029317584,0.00954124,-0.05309648,0.025462208,-0.033411846,-0.0005944611,0.005064184,-0.027676558,0.021318112,0.0016003068,-0.015370268,0.032427177,-0.30848962,-0.00023685994,0.01581102