('Facultad de Ingeniería Industrial. Creada en 1988. Acreditada internacionalmente. Excelente nivel académico. La Facultad de Ingeniería Industrial (FII) ofrece la carrera de Ingeniería Industrial, está acreditada internacionalmente y su cafetería es famosa por sus sándwiches y café. Sigla: FII. Categoría: Facultades. Horario: Lun–Sáb 8:00–22:00. Carreras: Ingeniería Industrial. Teléfono: 619-7000.'::text, '{"title": "Facultad de Ingeniería Industrial", "place_id": "facultad-de-ingenieria-industrial", "position": 0, "document_id": "place-facultad-de-ingenieria-industrial"}'::jsonb, '[0.017774036,0.027518021,0.017904684,-0.088781275,-0.010842824,-0.009277494,0.0054251743,0.029443275,0.020857194,0.0043632872,-0.035724424,0.03932287,-0.00059374544,0.05446888,0.1721725,0.030656198,0.016558778,-0.0029852004,0.02166297,-0.059660595,-0.006516298,-0.061531916,0.0015249845,-0.018344095,-0.02936096,0.018950943,0.046047978,-0.024027739,0.022266638,-0.022481302,-0.030303512,0.061345614,0.042368174,0.008885504,-0.017622266,-0.019484794,0.04649777,-0.018310225,-0.007257235,0.008163316,0.05891853,0.033399668,-0.0219506,0.01631549,0.04031656,-0.0126636615,0.025997795,-0.06251536,0.022956187,0.015163003,0.046973277,-0.00065820577,-0.032452058,-0.32075974,-0.010945107,-0.025833044,0.0060076443,0.01977165,-0.013209915,-0.03518092,-0.01716381,0.031717222,-0.051353645,0.0027293686,-0.04226913,-0.0059574028,-0.0019225661,0.04725427,0.027430687,-0.0072972197,-0.0027211313,-0.010857097,-0.013531347,-0.019092591,-0.013271633,-0.034695204,-0.0043276525,0.0318461,-0.00022399922,0.045696136,0.0008220708,-0.023482895,0.023631902,-0.005036195,0.059950687,0.012504109,0.019218048,0.031047583,-0.028593209,0.024441341,-0.0053487304,0.022801945,-0.029426545,-0.025977494,0.00090398564,-0.0017561635,0.015378214,-0.013777614,-0.03820188,-0.03244448,-0.0024101685,-0.008336281,0.02877403,0.011623878,0.003331733,-0.057102054,0.044893563,-0.028169688,-0.007145743,0.027621957,-0.01026836,0.03802826,-0.007908